# Data — regenerated by the pipeline, and far too large for git
data/
!data/.gitkeep

# Model artifacts. Random Forest runs to hundreds of megabytes -- 551 MB
# across five horizons -- so those stay out and are retrained locally.
#
# The XGBoost models ARE committed: 17.6 MB total, largest file 4.9 MB, and
# the deployment image copies them in rather than mounting a volume, since a
# managed container service has no host filesystem to mount from.
models/
!models/xgboost_*.pkl
!models/xgboost_*.json

# Generated figures. reports/results.md, model_comparison.csv and
# tuned_params.json ARE committed — they are small and they are the evidence.
reports/figures/
reports/logs/
reports/optuna_study.db

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Environments
.venv/
.venv_*/
venv/
env/

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Notebooks
.ipynb_checkpoints/